  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cambodia Media Development (CMD) Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this activity is to strengthen and expand the diversity of trustworthy news and information sources available to Cambodians so that they can be better equipped to participate in civic life. The CMD activity contains two main objectives: Objective 1: Institutionalization. Strengthen independent platforms for gathering and disseminating trustworthy news and information to Cambodian audiences. Objective 2: Innovation. Expand the means and methods used to bring Cambodians reliable, independent news and information. Objective 3: Resilience. Build the cohesion, security, and durability of Cambodias independent media sector.</narrative>
  </description>
